  "reviewed": false,
  "added": "2026-10-08"
 },
 "Press Home for the first basemap or End for the last one.": {
  "t": "最初のベースマップまたは最終のエンドのホームを押します。",
  "src": "libretranslate",
  "reviewed": false,
  "added": "2026-10-08"
 },
